346
00:15:02,020 --> 00:15:04,200
你真的没有因为访问的事而不爽吗
You really weren't mad about the interview?

347
00:15:04,940 --> 00:15:05,580
有一点
A little,

348
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:07,200
但我永远都在不爽你啊
but I'm always a little mad at you.

349
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:10,420
如果我害到你了  那很抱歉
I'm sorry if I screwed things up.

350
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:11,660
不必了
You don't have to be.

351
00:15:12,460 --> 00:15:14,400
我的确玩得很开心  麦克斯
I really did have fun, Max.

352
00:15:15,300 --> 00:15:17,881
看看你喜不喜欢我在你奶头上画的傻子眼睛
See if you like the googly-eyes I drew around your nipples.

353
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:21,500
真有意思  眼珠子的方向还不一样呢
Fun how they go in different directions.

354
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:27,740
抱歉我们来晚了
Sorry we're late.

355
00:15:27,820 --> 00:15:29,580
我得把大眼睛擦掉  因为画在我的...
I had to scrub the googly-eyes off my--

356
00:15:29,580 --> 00:15:30,840
自行车太多  有点堵了
bicycle traffic.

357
00:15:32,260 --> 00:15:32,980
我们开始吧
Well, let's get started.

358
00:15:33,380 --> 00:15:34,740
我本来应该跟我儿子史蒂夫吃午饭的
I'm supposed to have lunch with my son, Steve.

359
00:15:35,300 --> 00:15:37,140
但昨晚他去派对前  我们俩吵了一架
We had a little fight last night before he left for a party.

360
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:39,160
如果他发生什么不测  我一定会悲痛欲绝
If anything ever happened to him, I'd be devastated.

361
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:42,640
希望不是昨晚那个史蒂夫
Praying for a different Steve.

362
00:15:44,400 --> 00:15:47,040
这教室有一半的学生跟你亲热过
Wow, you made out with half the people in this room.

363
00:15:47,500 --> 00:15:49,460
我敢肯定其中一个切特被你搞大肚子了
I'm pretty sure you got one of the Chets pregnant.

364
00:15:51,060 --> 00:15:53,860
卡洛琳·钱宁是沃顿的校友
Caroline Channing is an alumni of Wharton,

365
00:15:53,860 --> 00:15:55,620
同时也是布鲁克林
and also the brains behind

366
00:15:55,620 --> 00:15:57,840
一家成功的新甜品酒吧的策划人
a thriving new dessert bar in Brooklyn,

367
00:15:57,880 --> 00:16:00,400
今天她来说说她的成功创业史
and she is here to tell us how she did it.

368
00:16:00,660 --> 00:16:03,840
对了  提醒一下总在我车后面写"洗我"的同学
Oh, also, um, whoever keeps writing "Wash me" in the back of my car,

369
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:05,220
洗字应该是三点水
there's no R in wash.

370
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:07,120
有请卡洛琳
Caroline.

371
00:16:08,420 --> 00:16:10,960
今天非常荣幸来到这里
It is a great honor to be here today.

372
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:14,220
这所优秀的学校教会我很多东西
I learned a lot at this fine institution.

373
00:16:14,660 --> 00:16:16,400
努力工作  诚实正直
Hard work, integrity,

374
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:18,620
还有一堆我永远用不上的数学
a lot of math I'll never use.

375
00:16:19,340 --> 00:16:21,640
这里有很多非常聪明的人
There are a lot of smart people here,

376
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:23,560
但我所认识的最聪明的人
but the smartest person I know,

377
00:16:23,780 --> 00:16:25,440
是跟我在餐厅当服务员的人
I met waiting tables in a diner.

378
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,000
麦克斯  转过来
Max, turn around.

379
00:16:30,234 --> 00:16:30,781
转过脸来
The other way.

380
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:36,400
我很骄傲地称她为我的搭档
And I am proud to call her my partner.

381
00:16:36,686 --> 00:16:38,123
"拉拉"味有点重
Gay.

382
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:40,940
我能来这里全拜她所赐
This woman is the reason I'm here today.

383
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:43,900
应该由她来演讲  她才是我成功的最大原因
She should be giving the speech because she's how I did it.

384
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:45,540
她叫麦克斯·布莱克
Her name is Max Black.

385
00:16:48,420 --> 00:16:50,100
你这是干什么  你要走了吗
Um, what're you doing? You're leaving?

386
00:16:50,620 --> 00:16:52,020
他们已经够羡慕嫉妒恨了
They're jealous enough,

387
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:53,940
我想你拥有自己的成功时刻
and I want you to have your moment.

388
00:16:54,280 --> 00:16:55,780
你也该两者兼得
You should get to have both too.

389
00:16:56,260 --> 00:16:57,687
而且我要去吐了
And also, chug-chug has to puke-puke.

390
00:17:01,220 --> 00:17:02,181
那...  好吧
And, uh, all right...

391
00:17:04,300 --> 00:17:05,940
我没有上过大学
I didn't go to college,

392
00:17:05,940 --> 00:17:08,320
但在这里待了一晚后
but after spending some time here,

393
00:17:08,540 --> 00:17:09,920
我想我可以教你们几招
I think I could teach you a few things.
